@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title UC3: Place an Order - Activity Diagram
start
:Customer browses menus from multiple brands at chosen Hub;
:Add items to cart across brands within the same hub;
:Proceed to checkout review;
if (Voucher provided?) then (yes)
  :Enter voucher code;
  :System verifies voucher validity, expiry, and min order;
  :Apply discount to order subtotal;
else (no)
endif
:Select payment method (E-wallet or COD);
:Customer confirms and submits order;
:System processes payment authorization;
if (Payment authorized?) then (success)
  :Create Order in 'Placed' status;
  :Route order to hub kitchen display with 2-min SLA timer;
  :Display order confirmation and live ETA tracking screen;
else (failed)
  :Notify payment failure and offer payment retry;
endif
stop
@enduml
